205: /****************************************************************************
206:  * Name: esp_mipi_dsi_dma_restart
207:  *
208:  * Description:
209:  *   Re-arm a single-item DW-GDMA link list so the same framebuffer keeps
210:  *   streaming.
211:  *
212:  * Input Parameters:
213:  *   priv - Driver private state
214:  *
215:  * Returned Value:
