592: /****************************************************************************
593:  * Name: esp_mipi_dsi_wait_cmd_not_full
594:  *
595:  * Description:
596:  *   Poll until the generic command FIFO has space for a new header, or
597:  *   until MIPI_DSI_FIFO_TIMEOUT_MS elapses.
598:  *
599:  * Input Parameters:
600:  *   hal  - MIPI-DSI HAL context
601:  *   what - Context string used in the timeout error log
602:  *
603:  * Returned Value:
604:  *   Zero (OK) on success; -ETIMEDOUT if the FIFO stays full.
605:  *
606:  ****************************************************************************/
607: 
608: static int esp_mipi_dsi_wait_cmd_not_full(FAR mipi_dsi_hal_context_t *hal,
609:                                           FAR const char *what)
